,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Description**\n\nWhen viewing chat responses in Copilot Chat, the vertical scrollbar overlaps with the right edge of the chat messages, causing the end of the text to be hidden behind the scrollbar (see screenshot).\n\n**Steps to Reproduce**\n1. Open Copilot Chat in VS Code (Insiders/macOS).\n2. Call the inline chat in the terminal and ask a question.\n3.Scroll through or display a long chat response.\n4. Observe that the scrollbar sits on top of the message text, rather than adjacent to it.\n\n**Expected Behavior**\nThe scrollbar should not overlap the message content; the chat panel should include padding or a separate area to render the scrollbar without obscuring text.\n\n**Actual Behavior**\nThe scrollbar renders over the message text, making the last characters of each line unreadable.\n\n**Environment**\n- OS: macOS\n- VS Code: Insiders (v1.101.0-20250523 or later)\n- Copilot Chat extension: v0.28.0\n\n**Screenshot**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1506795-c445-48aa-b256-7e21a911130c)","closed_by":{"login":"dmitrivMS","id":9581278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1ODEyNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9581278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrivMS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_typ